data: {"id": "c6202b958ba44d81-final", "run_id": "c6202b958ba44d81", "seq": 1117, "ts_ms": 1789141548503, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod `workload` in `aiops-case-v10` namespace is in `CrashLoopBackOff` state. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `resource_request.memory: 8Mi`, `resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` | 提供资源约束上下文；限制极低但非本次启动失败的主因 |\n| 2 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing` (fact-15fa015b88a8) | 直接定位应用启动失败的根本原因，指出缺失必需的环境变量 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container app` (fact-51499269e5c4) | 确认容器持续崩溃导致 K8s 进入指数退避重启状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code: 78` (fact-028e9dabba34), `container.last_terminated_reason: Error` (fact-a8233e1bd668) | 验证应用进程因错误代码 78 被强制终止，印证启动配置缺失导致退出 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 9` (fact-f5ed062dde42) | 确认该异常已引发多次重启循环，符合 CrashLoopBackOff 特征 |\n\n**证据关联分析：**\n日志 (fact-2) 明确记录了应用启动失败的直接原因（缺失配置），直接导致容器以退出码 78 终止 (fact-4)；Kubernetes 事件 (fact-3) 和指标 (fact-5) 分别描述了系统层面的重启退避现象及重启次数，这些维度共同构成了“应用启动失败 -> 退出 -> 集群重启”的完整证据链。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 中缺失 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 环境变量 (fact-2) → 应用启动时检测到配置缺失并调用 sys.exit(78) (fact-4) → 容器以 Error 状态终止并触发 K8s 重启退避 (fact-3) → Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (fact-1, fact-5)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用 `workload` 启动失败的根本原因是其配置缺失。\n\n日志事实明确指出 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing` (fact-2)，这导致应用程序无法正常启动并以退出码 78 终止 (fact-4)。这种应用层面的启动崩溃直接触发了 Kubernetes 的重启机制，并在连续失败后进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (fact-3, fact-1)。Kubernetes 事件与 Prometheus 指标 (fact-5) 验证了重启循环的持续性。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 72.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v10/workload: 72.6s (Evidence 65.6s, RCA 6.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v10/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 96.78, "metrics": {"run_id": "c6202b958ba44d81", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 96.78710198402405, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 96787.10198402405, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 72775.10833740234, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 51894.09780502319, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 23649.887084960938},